#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/permissions.rst:2
msgid "VMware Permissions"
msgstr "VMware Permissions"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/permissions.rst:4
msgid ""
"When integrating VMware vCenter with |morpheus|, users must supply "
"credentials for a vCenter account and |morpheus| will only have access "
"privileges equal to the integrated account. Many users will choose to use"
" a vCenter administrator account so that |morpheus| can freely do any "
"function in vCenter without worrying about hitting access limits. Others,"
" for security reasons, may want to restrict |morpheus| only to the "
"minimum permissions it needs to perform its functions. Follow the guide "
"in this section to configure a user with minimal permissions and "
"associate it with the appropriate usage levels before using it to create "
"a |morpheus| Cloud integration."
msgstr ""
"When integrating VMware vCenter con |morpheus|, users debe supply "
"credentials para un vCenter cuenta y |morpheus| será solo tienen acceso "
"privileges equal to el integrated cuenta. Many users será choose to use "
"un vCenter administrator cuenta so que |morpheus| puede freely do "
"cualquier función in vCenter sin worrying about hitting acceso limits. "
"Others, para security reasons, puede want to restrict |morpheus| solo to "
"el mínimo permisos it needs to perform its functions. Follow el guía en "
"esta sección to configure un usuario con minimal permisos y associate it "
"con el apropiado usage levels antes de using it to create un |morpheus| "
"Cloud integration."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/permissions.rst:7
msgid "Create vCenter Users and Roles"
msgstr "Create vCenter Users y Roles"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/permissions.rst:9
msgid ""
"For this example, I've added a new local user to be my |morpheus| "
"integration user (Menu > |AdmUse| and Groups) but any existing user, "
"whether locally-created or sourced from an identity integration (like "
"Active Directory), works fine."
msgstr ""
"For este ejemplo, I've agregado un nuevo local user to be my |morpheus| "
"integration user (Menu > |AdmUse| y Groups) pero cualquier existente "
"user, whether locally-creado o sourced desde un identity integration "
"(like Active Directory), works fine."

